/* --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Phase 126 — Wide Portrait & Token Picker
 * --------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Match the Tile Map Maker modal width so portrait/token browsing has enough
 * room for multiple useful columns.
 */
